For the purposes of this license, Non-Commercial Academic Use means use of the Licensed Materials that:

a. Is undertaken primarily for education, teaching, independent scientific research, or academic evaluation;

b. Is not primarily intended to obtain commercial advantage or monetary compensation through exploitation of the Licensed Materials;

c. Does not involve productive enterprise deployment or the provision of commercial products or services based on licensed uses of the Licensed Materials; and

d. Complies with the attribution and other applicable conditions of this license.

The fact that research is conducted at an academic institution does not automatically establish that it is non-commercial.

Likewise, the receipt of a scholarship, public research grant, or institutional funding does not automatically make academic research commercial.

Research conducted in cooperation with commercial enterprises must be assessed according to its actual purpose, contractual arrangements, exploitation rights, and intended use of the Licensed Materials.

Where the intended use falls outside the permissions expressly granted by this license, separate written authorization is required.

